        <span class="v16-pane-lead">${i("M\u1EABu d\xE0n d\u1EF1ng to\xE0n c\u1EA3nh k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p s\u1EB5n nhi\u1EC1u nh\xE2n v\u1EADt tr\xEAn s\xE2n kh\u1EA5u, \u0111\u1ED9i h\xECnh ti\u1EBFt m\u1EE5c 3D v\xE0 chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED9ng theo beat ch\u1EC9 v\u1EDBi 1 c\xFA nh\u1EA5p.","One-click full-stage setups combining multiple stage performers, 3D act formations, and beat-synced motion.")}</span>
